      "source": "ProCyclingUK",
      "image_url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795016338/cycling-bot/a7f9a81749-0.jpg",
      "image_urls": [
        "https://res.cloudinary.com/nnmxf7gb/image/upload/v1795016338/cycling-bot/a7f9a81749-0.jpg"
      ],
      "full_caption": "Nils Eekhoff has a new team for the next few seasons.\n\nThe rider is joining Decathlon CMA CGM on a contract running through 2028, following his exit from Picnic PostNL. The move was reported by ProCyclingUK.\n\nHow will Eekhoff fit into his new team's plans for 2026 and beyond?\n\nSource: ProCyclingUK\n\n#cycling #procycling #roadcycling #WorldTour #cyclingtransfers #NilsEekhoff #DecathlonCMACGM #PicnicPostNL #cyclingnews #peloton",
