      ],
      "full_caption": "The maglia rosa is getting a new maker. 🩷\n\nAustralian brand MAAP has agreed a multi-year partnership with RCS to supply apparel across its races, including the men's and women's Giro d'Italia. Cyclingnews understands the new pink jersey will differ significantly from the Castelli-made version, with the design due to be shown in the New Year.\n\nWill a bolder maglia rosa suit the Giro?\n\nSource: Cyclingnews\n\n#Giro #GirodItalia #MagliaRosa #MAAP #RCS #Cycling #RoadCycling #ProCycling #CyclingNews #CyclingKit",
